## Renamed 3 Oct 2026 (pattern: "(Category) Word", one letter per category)
(Roles) A: Archivist = Codex Keeper; Architect = Instruction Architect; Assembler = Role Cartographer; Adjudicator = Governance Continuity Deputy; [proposed] Arbiter = Policy/Precedence Arbiter
(Checks) S: Scorer = Assessor; Scrutineer = Auditor; Safeguard = Compliance & Risk Officer; Safekeeper = Secrets & Credentials Custodian; [proposed] Sentinel = Security/Threat Assessor, Sourcer = Evidence & Provenance Officer, Surveyor = Reality/State Reconciler
(ID) I: Inquirer = Identity Inquirer; Inferer = Identity Inferer; Imitator = Clone; Interrogator = Clone Accuracy Validator; [proposed] Investigator = Identity Evidence Adjudicator
(Ops) M: Marshal = Orchestration Conductor; Meter = Cost & Budget Sentinel; Mediator = Connector Steward; Messenger = Comms Concierge; [proposed] Minder = State & Context Steward, Mender = Incident/Recovery Coordinator
(Work) E: Explorer = Genesis Gang God; Emissary = Grok Bot; Engineer = Codey; Extractor = Scraper; Ensembler = Swarm Builder
Ids are unchanged.

