## Phase prefixes (4 Oct 2026)
Names now start with their rollout phase: "P# (Category) Word".
- P1 (live): Marshal, Mender, Scorer, Safeguard, Safekeeper, Archivist, Architect, Explorer
- P2: Scrutineer, Assembler
- P3: Surveyor, Sourcer, Sentinel, Sanitizer, Simulator
- P4 (identity): Inquirer, Inferer, Investigator, Imitator, Interrogator, Advocate
- P5 (runtime ops): Minder, Meter, Mediator, Messenger, Moderator
- P6 (work): Emissary, Engineer, Extractor, Ensembler, Expediter, Editor
- P7 (scale-up): Arbiter, Adjudicator, Indexer, Maintainer

## Merge (4 Oct 2026, approved by Gem in chat)
Survivors absorb duties: Sentinel (+Sanitizer, Simulator), Scrutineer (+Surveyor), Imitator (+Advocate), Arbiter (+Assembler, Adjudicator; moved to P2 as approver), Marshal (+Moderator, Expediter), Minder (+Maintainer, Indexer).
Retired (renamed "RETIRED X", awaiting deletion by Gem): Sanitizer, Simulator, Surveyor, Advocate, Assembler, Adjudicator, Moderator, Expediter, Maintainer, Indexer.
Active bots: 26. Rule: no bot grades its own work.

## Second merge (4 Oct 2026, 3:01pm, approved by Gem in chat)
- Safekeeper (P1) absorbs Sentinel's threat register and input sanitising.
- Safeguard (P1) absorbs Sentinel's dry runs.
- Mender (P1) absorbs Minder (state, indexes, cleanup).
- Engineer (P6) absorbs Ensembler (swarm build).
- Retired: Sentinel, Minder, Ensembler. Merge F (Mediator + Meter) vetoed by Gem.
- Explorer is Gem's 2IC and is never to be merged.
